	array(
		'question_text'  => 'A therapist in a small community begins treating a client who participates in the same cultural organization. The overlap was difficult to avoid, and both parties initially established a public-contact plan. Later, the therapist hires the client for personal work, accepts the client’s help promoting the practice, and begins making treatment exceptions because of the client’s community influence. Which response best reflects the ethical analysis?',
