CTA Exam Strategy: Separate each role instead of labeling the entire situation simply as a “dual relationship.” Use: ROLE → POWER → BENEFIT → RISK → RULE; What roles exist? Could the client freely refuse? Who primarily benefits? How is treatment affected? Is the overlap manageable, exploitative, or prohibited?',
