	array(
		'question_text'  => 'A therapist: Accepts increasingly expensive gifts from a financially vulnerable client. Hires the client for personal work. Deducts the wages from therapy fees. Recommends products that generate commissions for the therapist. Continues ineffective treatment because the therapist needs the income. Conceals the arrangements from colleagues. Which response best reflects the ethical analysis?',
